re is a pair of pointy fox ears and a fluffy tail. She’s usually quite careless, even a bit ignorant, but she’s reliable at critical moments."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c84912"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c6/c64fc2fdc0aec4ed4ee869fb232651ecf2f8a700d376de814e97f01a4948eb1c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9e/9eb9a7a99a484c988be593445d144df491d7319f88ccba0f73726f40007ce438.webp","width":221,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c84913","characterName":"Purin","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c84913"},"originalCharacterName":"Purin","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"As a rabbit girl with long ears that's summoned by the sound of the wind chimes, she’s as gentle and lovely as the rabbit she is, along with her way of treating others. But she can be very sneaky and gnarly sometimes..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c84913"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/95/959f365e19af37d6993c89d801c5b12e12de6f2eee0fb0b63ae1c13ba8915747.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/df0267604bae49192c0552e37ffefdcd10bf2ae7fbaac79a37533341a7cdcae5.webp","width":177,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c84914","characterName":"Puff","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c84914"},"originalCharacterName":"Puff","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Well, obviously, look at her round brown ears, she must be a bear. She’s very strong, a bit lazy, easy-going, clever and surprisingly crafty. Sometimes, you just can’t figure out what’s in her mind with that poker face."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c84914"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5d/5d5693a119fffa6755518ab8f4aaf338e58c129eb9d9650c29ce962dec6bfd1f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d7/d79282664568882ad2a1224902cf2bc8974acfc87589456e12fc8e731061441d.webp","width":159,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c93287","characterName":"Yella Lester","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c93287"},"originalCharacterName":"Yella Lester","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A vampire who has lived for so long she can't even remember her age. She came to the new continent in a ship filled with settlers when the new continent was first discovered. She claimed to have accumulated countless wealth, and even possessed supernatural powers far beyond the capacities of any ordinary human. As long as she had Raylan to accompany her, this new world would certainly be an interesting experience for her even though three hundred years have passed..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c93287"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/92/